{
  "case_id": "demo-fe-coch-001",
  "entries": [
    {
      "field": "paper_card.research_question",
      "claim": "如何用简单、室温、环保的方法对钴基碳酸氢氧化物实现电子结构与形貌的双重调控，获得媲美 RuO2 的 OER 电催化剂，并进一步降低水电解能耗",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "1",
        "paragraph": 2,
        "page": 1870,
        "figure": null,
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§1 ¶2, p.1870-1871"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.data",
      "claim": "自支撑电极：CoCH NW/CC（前驱体）、Fe-CoCH NT/CC（目标）、Fe-CoP NT/CC（磷化衍生）；表征：XRD、SEM、TEM、HRTEM、SAED、STEM-EDX、XPS、ICP-OES；电化学：LSV、CV、EIS、CP（1.0 M KOH）",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "2",
        "paragraph": 1,
        "page": 1871,
        "figure": "Fig. 1",
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§2 ¶1, p.1871, Fig. 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.method",
      "claim": "室温 Fe3+ 刻蚀 + 水解沉淀：CoCH 中 Co2+ 与 Fe3+ 离子交换，表面水解沉淀 Fe(OH)3，形成枝状纳米管阵列；进一步磷化衍生 Fe-CoP 相",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "1",
        "paragraph": 3,
        "page": 1871,
        "figure": "Fig. 1a",
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§1 ¶3, p.1871, Fig. 1a"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.method_conditions",
      "claim": "室温浸泡（Fe3+ 溶液）；>30 min 表面变粗糙、>90 min 形成纳米管；Fe3+ 浓度与浸泡时间显著影响性能；1.0 M KOH 电解液；ABE 系统需双极膜（BPM）防止酸碱中和",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "2",
        "paragraph": 2,
        "page": 1871,
        "figure": "Fig. S2",
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§2 ¶2, p.1871, Fig. S2, S6"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.main_findings",
      "claim": "1) Fe-CoCH NT 为内层结晶 CoCH + 外层无定形 Fe(OH)3，Fe:Co≈0.18:1；2) 碱性 OER η10=290 mV（RuO2/CC 为 280 mV，>30 mA cm-2 时优于 RuO2），法拉第效率>98%，ECSA 虽更低但本征活性更高、Rct 更低；3) 长期 OER 后表面重构（Co2+→Co3+ 为主，约 16.36% Fe 溶出），真实活性相初步为 Fe-CoOOH；4) 磷化后 Fe-CoP NT/CC 碱性 HER η10=150 mV、酸性 η10=93 mV；5) AWE（Fe-CoCH//Fe-CoP）1.67 V@10 mA cm-2；ABE 0.97 V@10 mA cm-2，能耗 25.79 vs 44.40 kWh/kgH2，降低 41.9%",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "2",
        "paragraph": 3,
        "page": 1872,
        "figure": "Fig. 3",
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§2 ¶3-7, p.1872-1874, Fig. 3-6"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.conclusions",
      "claim": "室温离子交换+水解沉淀策略制得枝状 FeCo 基氢氧化物纳米管阵列，碱性 OER 性能媲美 RuO2；基于该催化剂与衍生 FeCo 基磷化物构建酸碱混合电解系统，仅需 0.97 V 即可达 10 mA cm-2，能耗较传统碱性水电解降低 41.9%；方法可扩展到 Cu/Ni 基氢氧化物及 Ru3+/Ir3+/Rh3+ 等金属离子",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "3",
        "paragraph": 1,
        "page": 1874,
        "figure": null,
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§3 ¶1, p.1874"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.limitations",
      "claim": "1) 明确的 OER 活性物质仍需原位 Raman 和 XPS 确认（当前为初步发现）；2) Fe-CoP 的 HER 性能不如 Pt/C 和 CoP NW/CC，Fe 掺杂程度需精细调控（并非总是有益）；3) ABE 电池电压还受膜与电极间距影响；4) 长期测试约 16.36% Fe 溶出（稳定性隐患）",
      "anchor": {
        "section": "2",
        "paragraph": 8,
        "page": 1873,
        "figure": null,
        "table": null,
        "formula": null,
        "locator": "§2 ¶8, §3, p.1873-1874"
      }
    },
    {
      "field": "paper_card.preconditions",
      "claim": "结论成立前提：性能基于 1.0 M KOH、10 mA cm-2 标准条件；ABE 能耗优势依赖双极膜隔开酸碱两室；Fe 掺杂对 OER 有益、对 HER 不必然有益；RuO2 对比数据为同条件自测",
      "anchor": {
